-- Affected topics: Advanced Basis Calculations, Entity Choice and Planning, Capital Structure Tax Planning, Related Party Transactions, Entity Formation and Restructuring, Multi-Jurisdictional Tax Planning, Entity Formation and Liquidation, Passive Activity and At-Risk Rules

